Package: genies
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Daniel Nepp <d.nepp@globaltcad.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxi6, libxrender1, libxtst6, libfontconfig1
Recommends: podman
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Description: chat with AI agents that each have a sandboxed Linux desktop
 Genies is a chat app whose every conversation partner is an AI agent, a
 genie. Each genie lives in a lamp: a rootless podman container with a Linux
 desktop, where it can install programs, run them and look at its own screen,
 without reaching your files.
